    <!--
      Melo, as in the app: he blinks, waves, talks, does his shy wiggle with
      hearts, hops, then spins with sparkles, over and over (about 10 s).
      Widgets can't play animations, so a flipper steps through 68 frames
      rendered from his 3D page (melo_widget_00…67) every 150 ms, switching
      straight from one to the next (fading between them made him flicker).
      It only runs while the widget is on screen.
    -->
